{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49408","headline":"春光好 一 · 和凝","name":"春光好 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纱窗暖，画屏闲，嚲云鬟。\n睡起四肢无力，半春[间]。\n玉指翦裁罗胜，金盘点缀酥山。\n窥宋深心无限事，小眉弯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"和凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49408.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49408","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}